          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    None of this means a services offer is a mistake for freshers in these situations. It means the decision
    needs a real comparison against what else is on the table, not a reflexive "take it because it's IT"
    default.
  </p>

  <h2 id="checkpoint">Use The 4-Checkpoint Protocol before you decide</h2>

  <p>
    A single salary number cannot tell you whether this fits your specific life. The 4-Checkpoint Protocol
    narrows the decision to what actually matters for you.
  </p>

  <div class="protocol-stack">
    {checkpointItems.map((item) => (
